OL,3,GNEWSAMcFly first act announced for
OL,4,ALudlow concerts
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcFly are the first act to be announced
OL,7,Ffor a series of concerts at Ludlow
OL,8,FCastle next summer.
OL,10,FThe Live at Ludlow Castle events have
OL,11,Fbeen running since 2023 and this summer
OL,12,F50,000 people visited over two
OL,13,Fweekends.
OL,15,FMcFly were formed in 2003 and are
OL,16,Ffamous for songs such as Five Colours
OL,17,FIn Her Hair and All About You.
OL,19,FThey are due to appear at the castle on
OL,20,F27 July 2027 and the promoters,
OL,21,FFuturesound Group, said more
OL,22,Fannouncements would follow.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
